        "date": "May 09, 2023",
        "title": "New spaces",
        "body": "<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"400\" id=\"BLOGGER_PHOTO_ID_7231321650565950098\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhX-JgCaoBJP3uvVsbpnmO-lqgM8F8ezd8bboB0BW75L0dqYufY0edTwGYDyJJKjZ-ot4WV-Rfud2-zJ7BG3_WL9SdfnEDz-ljDrWyOUb9jqSij6DnM2xHuKEj7gNg9nlekU4NjOctF8gNCdn0wRpSNfPJpO0x6IqnczbB2G8TJ3uzvuN5p2Q=w400-h400\" width=\"400\" />\n\nThat's all it takes, sometimes.  Just get me out of the norm. Then I can see the world as it should be seen; the lens becomes less foggy.  I do not seek clarity, only normality."
